Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Did you know that octopuses\Nhave three hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Imagine that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Let’s explore why they\Nneed so many
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Think of one heart as the\Nmain pump
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like the big engine of a train
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}This heart sends blood all\Naround the octopus's body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}giving it the energy to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}swim and explore the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}This is much like how your\Nheart pushes blood through\Nyour body so you can run
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}But the octopus is special\Nbecause it also has two extra\Nhearts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}helpers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}These two hearts focus on its\Ngills
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}which are the octopus's way\Nto breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}underwater
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}just like how you breathe air\Nwith your lungs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}The helper hearts keep the\Nblood moving through the\Ngills quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}making sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}the octopus gets plenty of\Noxygen from the water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}So next time you think of an\Noctopus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}remember those three\Nhearts working
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It's like having a team of\Nlittle engines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}each with its own important\Njob
